2\" id=\"badges-desktop\"><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"inline-flex relative items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-zest tooltip after:bg-black after:text-xs after:text-white cursor-pointer bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-600 text-emerald-950\" target=\"_blank\" data-tooltip-text=\"The seller has confirmed whether the vehicle is drivable.\"><i class=\"icon text-base leading-none\">fact_check</i><span>Function tested</span></a><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"inline-flex relative items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-zest tooltip after:bg-black after:text-xs after:text-white cursor-pointer bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-900\" target=\"_blank\" data-tooltip-text=\"Transport can be arranged for this vehicle.\"><i class=\"icon text-base leading-none\">local_shipping</i><span>Transport available</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-neutral-500 mt-8 mb-6 justify-between md:justify-start\"><a href=\"#data-sheet\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base border-b text-black\">Overview</a><a href=\"#bid-container\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Bids</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">14</span></a><a href=\"#comments\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Comments</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">2</span></a><a href=\"/en/auctions/2012-jaguar-xj-gwt89r-2/albums\" class=\"flex pb-3 border-black gap-2 items-center text-sm sm:text-base\"><span>Photos</span><span class=\"text-xs h-5 px-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-500 text-off-white flex items-center justify-center\">184</span></a></div><div class=\"mb-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-lg border-l-4 border-racing-700\"><blockquote class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"md:text-lg italic text-neutral-700 mb-0\">“Classy luxury car, well cared for and at a reasonable price.”</p></blockquote><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"/assets/jens-trulsson-6e331e91.jpg\" alt=\"Jens Trulsson\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full\"><div><div class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900\">Jens Trulsson</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600\">Responsible consignor</div></div></div></div><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-xl mb-4\" id=\"data-sheet\">Data sheet</h2><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Year: </span><span>2012</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Manufacturer: </span><span>Jaguar</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Model: </span><span>XJ</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Color: </span><span>Blue</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior color: </span><span>Light brown</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Interior material: </span><span>Leather</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Engine displacement: </span><span>3.0</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Drive: </span><span>Rear-wheel drive</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Propulsion: </span><span>Diesel</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Steering: </span><span>LHD</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Transmission: </span><span>Automatic</span></li><li><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">Odometer: </span><span>245 000 km</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-1 col-span-2\"><span class=\"text-neutral-500\">VIN: </span><span class=\"flex gap-1 items-center relative\"><span>SAJAA162X********</span><span class=\"bg-red-50 border-rose-100 text-au-chico tooltip after:bg-red-50 after:border-rose-100 rounded-full flex items-center\" data-tooltip-text=\"To view this vehicle's VIN number you'll need be logged in. Create your account now, it only takes a minute!\"><span class=\"icon\">info</span></span></span></li></ul><div class=\"video-container w-full relative mb-8\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jM9Vq16LUTg?si=fBvxkvfMKVE-64S1\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div><div class=\"auction-body\"><h2>Basic information and history</h2><p> The 2012 Jaguar XJ is part of the X351 generation, designed by Ian Callum (Aston Martin DB7 and Volvo C70 Coupé, among others) with a focus on a contemporary silhouette and a lightweight aluminum-based construction. The model combines a comfort-oriented chassis, precise roadholding and an interior built around classic material choices and a modern cockpit.</p><p> This lovely deep blue example is imported from <strong>the Netherlands</strong> . The current odometer reading is <strong>245,805 kilometers</strong> and the seller states that the odometer reading can be guaranteed. The seller describes the car as a lovely long-distance car that attracts attention.</p><p> The car is delivered <strong>freshly serviced</strong> and <strong>inspected</strong> prior to delivery.</p><h2> Equipment and options</h2><ul><li> Winter wheels on original rims, tread depth approximately five millimeters</li><li> Summer wheels on original rims, tread depth approximately four millimeters</li></ul><p> <strong>Modifications and improvements:</strong> No known aftermarket modifications have been reported. Ongoing maintenance has been performed according to service instructions.</p><h2> Condition</h2><p> <strong>Body and exterior:</strong> The paint is in good condition considering the year and mileage. There are some minor door chips on the body sides. The windows are flawless. The chrome, moldings, headlight lenses and emblems are reported to be in good condition considering the year and mileage.</p><p> <strong>Interior:</strong> The interior is in very good condition according to the seller. The headliner is flawless. The steering wheel, controls and buttons show no significant wear. Note that the paint on the wooden panel in the right front door has a crack.</p><p> <strong>Tires and rims:</strong> The car is delivered with winter tires mounted on original rims, tread depth approximately five millimeters. A set of summer tires on original rims is included, tread depth approximately four millimeters. Some edge scratches are present on the rims.</p><p> <strong>Mechanics and function:</strong> The engine is well maintained and works perfectly, according to the report. The gearbox and driveline are well maintained and the oils and filters have been changed according to the service instructions. The brakes work well according to both the seller and the accompanying inspection report.</p><h2> Service history</h2><p> The service book is completed according to the manufacturer's intervals and all service measures are documented in the service book. <strong>The last service was carried out on March 2, 2026.</strong> The work has been carried out by <i>Kroymans Jaguar BV</i> and <i>AWF Fordonsteknik</i>. Documentation from the service book and any protocols are available according to the seller.</p><p> The car <b>was approved without any remarks during the inspection on March 2, 2026</b>.</p><h2> Summary</h2><p> A beautifully blue metallic and well cared for Jaguar XJ from 2012 with documented service history. The car is imported from the Netherlands, has an odometer reading of 245,805 kilometers which can be guaranteed and is delivered both <b>newly serviced and inspected</b>. The exterior shows some minor door dings, the interior is very well preserved with a noted crack in the paint on the wooden panel in the right front door. Winter wheels and summer wheels on original rims are included. The seller also states that the manufacturer's equipment list is included to get a full specification of factory equipment.</p><p> <i>All information in the ad is the seller's own.</i></p></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-white border border-green-200 rounded-md shadow-sm p-2 md:p-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-800\">Function Check</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-x-3 md:gap-y-1 grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4\"><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Drivable</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-red-600 cursor-help\" title=\"Bilen leveras nybesiktad\"><span class=\"icon text-red-500 text-lg\">close</span><span>Inspection OK</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Climate control</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Trip meter</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Media system</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Electronics</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Warning lights</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Seat belts</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Lighting</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Engine</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Brakes</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center md:gap-1 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium text-green-700\"><span class=\"icon text-green-500 text-lg\">check</span><span>Gearbox</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-neutral-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-12\">The description of this auction item is, to the seller's knowledge, accurate and not misleading. Bidders Highway gathers details from the seller and performs some background checks, but does not carry out a full inspection, and the transaction is between the buyer and the seller. It is up to the bidder to ensure the description is correct and to do any research they deem necessary before placing a binding bid. <b>Study the many images carefully and form your own opinion on the condition, and use the comments section to ask questions.</b> See our general terms and conditions for full details.</div><div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6 text-sm\"><div class=\"text-center\">Do you also own a Jaguar XJ or similar? <a class=\"underline hover:text-zest transition-colors\" href=\"/en/sales_inquiries/new\">Contact us</a> and we'll quickly put you in touch with our sales specialists.</div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">2 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments